<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> When worn, you are put in an anti-memetic state and, when viewing any anomaly that seemingly creates matter or energy, you will see a rubber wire leading out of it and into the sky.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The foundation interacts with the 'electricity' that comes from these wires, until eventually they receive an invoice from the 'Electric Company' advising them to cease experimentation. They are successful in the creation of numerous useful anomalous devices before eventually, a 'Technician' appears in the site and retrieves the glasses before amnesticizing the foundation staff and deleting the file, which is found in data-backlogs by MTF-Rho 9. The item is considered neutralized for the time being.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The file is seemingly still anti-memetic and one needs to be conditioned using memetic images to view it. The underlying narrative of a foundation existing above the foundation responsible for the empowering of Anomalous items is the main hook of the article. Another piece of the puzzle is added to the mystery of where the energy for anomalies come from, with more room for expansion.</p>

